id=zte-charge-separate
name=Bypass Charge Separation (ZTE)
version=1.2.0
versionCode=3
author=oh-my-pi
description=Charge separation (bypass charging) for ZTE devices. Detects PC (USB data host, SDP/CDP) vs charger (DCP/PD) via charger_psy/usb_type; auto-engages separation only on PC, keeps Settings UI switch in sync, hard-engages the sysfs node below the vendor charge threshold.